Subject: [PATCH 07/41] webgl-shader-noise

WebGL shader-precision noise, plus the --webgl-shader-noise-k consumer:
comma-separated name=value overrides for the 13 per-surface multipliers,
parsed once per process (the switch itself is declared and propagated in
switch-resolver).
